  "question": {
    "text": "<p>For the reaction, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>aA</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>bB</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>cC</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>dD</mi><mo>,</mo></math> the plot of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></math>&nbsp;v/s <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is given below:</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/11cb36a8-269d-413e-8ab6-c6301f5dac27-image.png\" style=\"width: 226px; height: 174px;\" /></p><p>The temperature at which the rate constant of the reaction is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> is _____&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mo>.</mo></math><br />(Rounded-off to the nearest integer) [Given : The rat5e constant of the reaction is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>.]</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "526",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>Ea</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mi>RT</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>Slope</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>Ea</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>000</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>Ea</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>303</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>000</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>500</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mfenced><mfrac><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>000</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>500</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>526</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>31</mn><mo>&#8771;</mo><mn>526</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></p><p>Hence answer is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mn>526</mn></mfenced></math></p>",
